                eng: "My perfect Sunday has a very specific sequence. First of all, I wake up at sunrise. The house is very peaceful. Before I eat breakfast, I do twenty minutes of yoga. This helps energize my body. Following that, I take a slow walk in the park. In the middle of the day, I prioritize my hobbies, like reading or baking. After I complete my personal tasks, I start to unwind. Finally, at the end of the day, I watch the sunset and reflect on a beautiful weekend. I always sleep well after a day like this.",
