                eng: "For example, sending packages to another country can be complicated. When goods cross borders, you must fill out customs documents correctly. Customs officers can check any box to verify its value. However, wrong forms could delay your parcel for weeks. So, shippers should always write exact item details. Also, air shipping is fast, but it can cost a lot of money. In the end, following trade rules keeps global business safe and easy.",
